-title><html-annotation>The architecture review includes management, orchestration, and control-plane paths that can affect data routing or replication.</html-annotation><layout x="6160" y="20161" height="4320" width="4320" /><status-fields><status-field name="annotation" type="string">The architecture review includes management, orchestration, and control-plane paths that can affect data routing or replication.</status-field><status-field name="confidence" type="string">Low</status-field></status-fields></node><node reference="N95818729" bootstrap-role="claim"><type>1</type><user-id>N95818729</user-id><user-title>Administrative and IAM permissions cannot create non-EEA data paths.</user-title><html-annotation>Control-plane authorization is constrained so administrators cannot create or widen data paths outside the EEA.</html-annotation><layout x="10160" y="20161" height="4320" width="4320" /><status-fields><status-field name="annotation" type="string">Control-plane authorization is constrained so administrators cannot create or widen data paths outside the EEA.</status-field><status-field name="confidence" type="string">Medium</status-field></status-fields></node><node reference="N95818730" bootstrap-role="claim"><type>1</type><user-id>N95818730</user-id><user-title>Network and orchestration policies enforce EEA-only control paths.</user-title><html-annotation>Control-plane network policy and orchestration settings prevent managed actions from directing data or replicas outside the EEA.</html-annotation><layout x="10160" y="20161" height="4320" width="4320" /><status-fields><status-field name="annotation" type="string">Control-plane network policy and orchestration settings prevent managed actions from directing data or replicas outside the EEA.</status-field><status-field name="confidence" type="string">Medium</status-field></status-fields></node><node reference="N95818731" bootstrap-role="claim"><type>1</type><user-id>N95818731</user-id><user-title>Control-plane 