rence="N95818734" bootstrap-role="evidence-placeholder" bootstrap-placeholder="true"><type>3</type><user-id>N95818734</user-id><user-title>Evidence required: control-plane audit logs</user-title><html-annotation>Need audit logs showing control-plane activity during the assessed period did not direct data or replicas outside the EEA.</html-annotation><layout x="10160" y="20161" height="4320" width="4320" /><status-fields><status-field name="annotation" type="string">Need audit logs showing control-plane activity during the assessed period did not direct data or replicas outside the EEA.</status-field><status-field name="confidence" type="string">Low</status-field></status-fields></node><node reference="N95818735" bootstrap-role="claim"><type>1</type><user-id>N95818735</user-id><user-title>Integrated third-party sub-processors are contractually constrained to EEA processing.</user-title><html-annotation>Third-party contracts and data-processing terms require EEA-only processing and retention for integrated subprocessors.</html-annotation><layout x="15520" y="20161" height="4320" width="4320" /><status-fields><status-field name="annotation" type="string">Third-party contracts and data-processing terms require EEA-only processing and retention for integrated subprocessors.</status-field><status-field name="confidence" type="string">Medium</status-field></status-fields></node><node reference="N95818736" bootstrap-role="evidence-placeholder" bootstrap-placeholder="true"><type>3</type><user-id>N95818736</user-id><user-title>Evidence required: subprocessor contracts and DPAs</user-title><html-annotation>Need contract, DPA, or procurement evidence showing integrated subprocessors are bound to EEA processing/retention terms.</html-annotation><layout x="15520" y="20161" height="4320" width="4320" /><status-fields><status-field name="annotation" type="string">Need contract, DPA, or procurement evidence showing integrated subprocessors are bound to EEA processing/retention terms.</status-field><status-field name="confidence" type="string">Low</status-field></status-fields></node><node reference="N95818737" bootstrap-role="claim"><type>1</type><user-id>N95818737</user-id><user-title>The reviewed architecture includes management, orchestration, and control-plane paths.</user-title><html-annotation>The assessed architecture inventory explicitly includes the non-data-plane paths that can affect routing, replication, or export.</html-annotation><layout x="10840" y="20161" height="4320" width="4320" /><status-fields><status-field name="annotation" type="string">The assessed architecture inventory explicitly includes the non-data-plane paths that can affect routing, replication, or export.</status-field><status-field name="confidence" type="string">Medium</status-field></status-fields></node><node reference="N95818738" bootstrap-role="evidence-placeholder" bootstrap-placeholder="true"><type>3</type><user-id>N95818738</user-id><user-title>Evidence required: architecture diagrams and exception review</user-title><html-annotation>Need architecture diagrams, data-flow records, or exception review showing control-plane paths were included in the assessed lifecycle.</html-annotation><layout x="10840" y="20161" height="4320" width="4320" /><status-fields><status-field name="annotation" type="string">Need architecture diagrams, data-flow records, or exception review showing control-plane paths were included in the assessed lifecycle.</status-field><status-field name="confidence" type="string">Low</status-field></status-fields></node><node reference="N95818739" bootstrap-role="claim"><type>1</type><user-id>N95818739</user-id><user-title>First-hop vehicle traffic stays on EEA-based endpoints.</user-title><html-annotation>Branch for destination-IP / route inspection of vehicle-originating traffic within the assessed period.</html-annotation><layout x="15520" y="1" height="4320" width="4320" /><status-fields><status-field name="annotation" type="string">Branch for destination-IP / route inspection of vehicle-originating traffic within the assessed period.</status-field><status-field name="confidence" type="string">Medium</status-field></status-fields></node><node reference="N95818740" bootstrap-role="claim"><type>1</type><user-id>N95818740</user-id><user-title>Cloud and control-plane paths cannot export or replicate data outside the EEA.</user-title><html-annotation>Branch for management, orchestration, IAM, network-policy, and audit controls that could move data indirectly.</html-annotation><layout x="15520" y="1" height="4320" width="4320" /><status-fields><status-field name="annotation" type="string">Branch for management, orchestration, IAM, network-policy, and audit controls that could move data indirectly.</status-field><status-field name="confidence" type="string">Medium</status-field></status-fields></node><node reference="N95818741" bootstrap-role="claim"><type>1</type><user-id>N95818741</user-id><user-title>Integrated third-party sub-processors are constrained to EEA-only processing.</user-title><html-annotation>Branch for contractual and operational controls over integrated subprocessors.</html-annotation><layout x="15520" y="1" height="4320" width="4320" /><status-fields><status-field name="annotation" type="string">Branch for contractual and operational controls over integrated subprocessors.</status-field><status-field name="confidence" type="string">Medium</status-field></status-fields></node><node reference="N95818742" bootstrap-role="claim"><type>1</type><user-id>N95818742</user-id><user-title>The assessed architecture is complete for relevant data-exit paths.</user-title><html-annotation>Branch for architecture completeness across management-plane, logging, backup, telemetry, and other vendor-side export paths.</html-annotation><layout x="15520" y="1" height="4320" width="4320" /><status-fields><status-field name="annotation" type="string">Branch for architecture completeness across management-plane, logging, backup, telemetry, and other vendor-side export paths.</status-field><status-field name="confidence" type="string">Medium</status-field></status-fields></node><node reference="N95818743" bootstrap-role="evidence-placeholder" bootstrap-placeholder="true"><type>3</type><user-id>N95818743</user-id><user-title>Evidence required: destination-IP / route inspection</user-title><html-annotation>Need destination-IP logs, route tables, or equivalent network evidence showing vehicle-originating traffic only reached EEA-based endpoints during the assessed period.</html-annotation><layout x="19520" y="1" height="4320" width="4320" /><status-fields><status-field name="annotation" type="string">Need destination-IP logs, route tables, or equivalent network evidence showing vehicle-originating traffic only reached EEA-based endpoints during the assessed period.</status-field><status-field name="confidence" type="string">Low</status-field></status-fields></node><node reference="N95818744" bootstrap-role="evidence-placeholder" bootstrap-placeholder="true"><type>3</type><user-id>N95818744</user-id><user-title>Evidence required: control-plane export restrictions</user-title><html-annotation>Need IAM, orchestration, network-policy, configuration, or audit evidence showing control-plane actions cannot create non-EEA data paths or replication targets.</html-annotation><layout x="19520" y="1" height="4320" width="4320" /><status-fields><status-field name="annotation" type="string">Need IAM, orchestration, network-policy, configuration, or audit evidence showing control-plane actions cannot create non-EEA data paths or replication targets.</status-field><status-field name="confidence" type="string">Low</status-field></status-fields></node><node reference="N95818745" bootstrap-role="evidence-placeholder" bootstrap-placeholder="true"><type>3</type><user-id>N95818745</user-id><user-title>Evidence required: subprocessor contracts and DPAs</user-title><html-annotation>Need contracts, DPAs, procurement records, or audit evidence showing integrated subprocessors are bound to EEA-only processing and retention.</html-annotation><layout x="19520" y="1" height="4320" width="4320" /><status-fields><status-field name="annotation" type="string">Need contracts, DPAs, procurement records, or audit evidence showing integrated subprocessors are bound to EEA-only processing and retention.</status-field><status-field name="confidence" type="string">Low</status-field></status-fields></node><node reference="N95818746" bootstrap-role="evidence-placeholder" bootstrap-placeholder="true"><type>3</type><user-id>N95818746</user-id><user-title>Evidence required: architecture completeness review</user-title><html-annotation>Need architecture diagrams, data-flow records, or exception review showing management-plane, logging, backup, telemetry, and other export paths were included in scope.</html-annotation><layout x="19520" y="1" height="4320" width="4320" /><status-fields><status-field name="annotation" type="string">Need architecture diagrams, data-flow records, or exception review showing management-plane, logging, backup, telemetry, and other export paths were included in scope.</status-field><status-field name="confidence" type="string">Low</status-field></status-fields></node></nodes>
